
------------------------------------------------------------------------
| Feature              | Adjacency List       | Adjacency Matrix       |
|----------------------|----------------------|------------------------|
| Storage              | List of neighbors    | 2D matrix              |
| Space Complexity     | O(V + E)             | O(V²)                  |
| Edge Search          | O(V)                 | O(1)                   |
| Add Edge             | O(1)                 | O(1)                   |
| Remove Edge          | O(V)                 | O(1)                   |
| Memory Usage         | Less                 | More                   |
| Best For             | Sparse graphs        | Dense graphs           |
| Implementation       | More complex         | Simple                 |
| Main Advantage       | Saves memory         | Fast edge checking     |
| Main Disadvantage    | Slower edge searching| High memory usage      |
------------------------------------------------------------------------

-----------------------------------------------------------------------
|             Operation           | Adjacency List | Adjacency Matrix |
|---------------------------------|----------------|------------------|
| Check if edge u → v exists      | O(degree(u))   | O(1)             |
| Find all adjacent vertices of u | O(degree(u))   | O(V)             |
| Add an edge u → v               | O(1)           | O(1)             |
| Remove an edge u → v            | O(degree(u))   | O(1)             |
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
